{"id":"n78292-1-7","stage":4,"title":"참견 · 参与","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n78292-1-7-1","ko":"이야기를 들어 보니 네가 승규에게 잘못한 것 같은데.","zh":"听你这么一说，好像是你做错了事对不起承奎啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이야기를","meaning":"聊天，说话","explanation":"이야기：聊天，说话；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"이야기","audio":"/audio/ffe0179e59e74069bc54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60321","senseId":"2","lemma":"이야기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들어","meaning":"听说","explanation":"듣다：听说；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"4","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보니","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"승규에게","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"승규에게","audio":"/audio/798787cc441dabb00906.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"잘못한","meaning":"做错，做得不好","explanation":"잘못하다：做错，做得不好；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"잘못하다","audio":"/audio/c088e8817916a36c7669.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69936","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같은데.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；은데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ffe0179e59e74069","term":"이야기","zh":"聊天，说话","audio":"/audio/ffe0179e59e74069bc54.mp3","entryId":"60321","definition":"和别人交流的话。","pronunciation":["이야기"]},{"id":"58977b8705722edc","term":"듣다","zh":"听说","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3","entryId":"74104","definition":"接收他人口头上的传达内容。","pronunciation":["듣따"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"c088e8817916a36c","term":"잘못하다","zh":"做错，做得不好","audio":"/audio/c088e8817916a36c7669.mp3","entryId":"69936","definition":"做得有错或不对。","pronunciation":["잘모타다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/b3a332fd01e3d1edc0d6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n78292-1-7-2","ko":"네가 뭔데 참견이야?","zh":"你算什么，也敢来插手？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭔데","meaning":"表示对对方想法的轻微反驳或给予新的启发。","explanation":"뭐：表示对对方想法的轻微反驳或给予新的启发。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27525","senseId":"4","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"참견이야?","meaning":"参与，干预，过问，插嘴","explanation":"참견：参与，干预，过问，插嘴；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"참견","audio":"/audio/ca006f1fa936b2afe69f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78292","senseId":"1","lemma":"참견","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"表示对对方想法的轻微反驳或给予新的启发。","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"27525","definition":"表示对对方想法的轻微反驳或给予新的启发。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"ca006f1fa936b2af","term":"참견","zh":"参与，干预，过问，插嘴","audio":"/audio/ca006f1fa936b2afe69f.mp3","entryId":"78292","definition":"介入与自己无关的事情，出面或讲话。","pronunciation":["참견"]}],"audio":"/audio/2523ccc9779be833caa4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.816,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=78292","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":136,"sequenceScore":2.6427,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你算什么，也敢来插手？","听你这么一说，好像是你做错了事对不起承奎啊。","你怎么跑到外面来了？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["听你这么一说，好像是你做错了事对不起承奎啊。","你怎么跑到外面来了？","你算什么，也敢来插手？"],"answer":2}]}
